{"sourceUrl":"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/73/c11892a244083/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.002994+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/73/c11892a244083/page.htm","html":"<div><p><a href=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/73/c11892a244083/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>根据《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年接收推免生（含直博生）预报名通知》（药大研函〔</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>〕</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>34</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>号）等</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>文件精神，特制订本方案。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>一、接收硕士推免生第二批次报名专业目录</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业代码</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>专业</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>/</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>方向</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>名称/QQ联络群</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>1007J1</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>动物药学/<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/e5/1b/179242d54d33b955f5bde4b3590f/c3e405c8-229d-4e2e-96de-0cbfe16e1465.jpg\" title=\"\"/></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>100700</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>药学/149010108</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span><span><span>105500</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>01</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>药物合成与工艺优化<span>/149010108</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>04</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>新药临床前评价/1125671587</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>05</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>禁毒技术与毒物鉴定</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span>注：代码</span><span>100700</span><span>药学一级学科仅限报名学院“</span><span>3+1+X”</span><span>本研贯通人才培养直通车项目，且考核合格的本校学生报考。<br/></span><span><strong>   </strong></span><span><span><strong>  </strong></span><span><strong>请收到复试通知的同学于9月17日上午12点前加群，复试形式为线上，腾讯会议，具体开始时间加群后等群内老师通知！</strong></span><span><strong> </strong></span></span><span><strong>  <br/></strong></span><span><strong>     二、复试安排</strong></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、报名条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）全国高校</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生，所学专业为药学类、中药学类、化学类、生物科学类、化工与制药类、生物医学工程类、生物工程类、基础医学类、食品科学与工程类、经济学类、统计学类、管理学类等相关专业，且预计可获得所在高校推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）学习成绩优异，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力，具有相应研究生培养潜质。在校期间曾参加科学研究、全国学术竞赛等活动表现突出者，及具有代表性科研成果者优先考虑。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）同一个学院同一批次内限填报</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>个硕士志愿。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>考生不得在同一学院同一专业重复报名参加复试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>报名方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>有意参加且预计获得推荐免试资格的全国各院校</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>届应届本科毕业生可在</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日至</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>登录我校推免生预报名系统（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>http://yzs.cpu.edu.cn/logon</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>,</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。报名项目选择“推免生预报名”，并按提示上传报名材料。学院对申请人资格进行审核，并于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>前向入围的学生在系统中发送通知，未收到通知者即未入选，不再另行通知。收到通知学生请在接到通知后</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>小时内登录</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>系统确认。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、复试形式</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/73/c11892a244083/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试采用网络远程方式，拟使用“钉钉”、“腾讯会议”等办公软件，考核全过程在我院研究生招生委员会及录取工作监督小组的领导和监督下进行，严格坚持公开、公平、公正的原则。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/b9/73/c11892a244083/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>复试按照考生报考专业的情况分组进行。复试内容与考核形式由各学科确定，考核过程须坚持公开、公平、公正的原则。各学科将根据招生计划数及推免生报名情况，适时组织开展多批次复试录取工作，具体安排请随时关注我校研究生招生信息网和</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>药学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>网站。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、复试时间安排</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>本批次复试拟定于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日进行，具体时间以及考试会议号由考核组秘书老师另行通知。请保持预报名系统中填报的手机及邮箱畅通，一直不上线、并联系不上者，视为放弃本次复试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学生参加复试前需将《中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书》（见附件）和</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>请在我校研究生招生信息网下载专区下载打印</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>）签字盖章版扫描件发给考核组秘书老师。</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>《中国药科大学考生思想政治表现、自然情况审查表》</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>签字</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>盖章版原件</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>务必于</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日前邮寄至</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>药学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>邮寄信息：江苏省南京市江宁区龙眠大道</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>639</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>号中国药科大学</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>综合实验楼</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>G506</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>办公室，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>高</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>老师，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>025-8618</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>5301</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>。（只能使用顺丰快递，不可使用其他快递；面单上详细标明“政审表”！）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、学院推免生接收工作联系方式</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>gjy6266751@163.com</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>重点提醒：</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>我校推免拟录取的</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年应届本科毕业生，在全国推免服务系统开放（预计</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>21</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日）后，仍须在国家系统中注册并填报志愿，并根据实际进程完成接收、确认复试、待录取通知等相应程序。届时请关注我校研究生招生网和中国研究生招生信息网的通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://yxy.cpu.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/e5/1b/179242d54d33b955f5bde4b3590f/66b8b2a1-8c50-4d98-8e8c-0ab10ff8dd47.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"中国药科大学 2027 年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书.pdf\">中国药科大学 2027 年推荐免试研究生诚信复试承诺书.pdf</a><br/></p><p><span>                                                    <span><span><span><span>药学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>                         <span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>14</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"3db3ce5325c5baa34bb2642ea0f68f89d46407ee2fe15f9c94cd06d9ee61c334","textLength":1587,"sourceSha256":"3a9f1ef29277a958b50ffdf109b47809feb146fc1ea0ab613e8e6cdf8c96c701","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-b172faa03560c773e1b1","title":"2026年中国药科大学药学院2027年招收推荐免试研究生第二批次预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:09.002994+00:00"}
